  <number>1</number>
  <songtitle>Jatra Pathe</songtitle>
  <lyrics>Ja-tra pa-the na-_i-ba pe-lam to-mar pra-bhu de-___kha
Bhak-ti ba-re kar-_bo sma-ran to-mar pra-bhu re-___kha
My Lord_ on my way_ to the goa-_l if I see_ You not_
No harm no harm no__ harm with a de-vo-_tion--heart_
I shall re-mem-_ber You__ and Your foo-_t-steps</lyrics>
  <underlyrics>Jatra pathe naiba pelam
Tomar prabhu dekha
Bhakti bare karbo smaran
Tomar prabhu rekha</underlyrics>
  <translatedlyrics>My Lord, on my way to the Goal,
If I see You not, no harm, no harm, no harm.
With a devotion-heart I shall remember You
    And Your Footsteps.</translatedlyrics>
